  'Check it yourself: seed = keccak256(abi.encode(source hash, round, role)); remove tied candidates who withdrew or became ineligible (keep address order); winner = remaining[seed mod count].': 'Compruébelo usted mismo: seed = keccak256(abi.encode(source hash, round, role)); quite a los empatados que se retiraron o dejaron de ser elegibles (manteniendo el orden de direcciones); ganador = remaining[seed mod count].',
